<p>I like this SCP idea, I really do. But the problem that stood out to me the most is the fact that there is no storyline to this SCP article. Storylines aren't required but they can make any article significantly more interesting. For this maybe you could focus on SCP-4483's discovery and then how it was discovered and why, but I recommend having a story that will leave readers with questions and will keep them guessing of what might happen next.</p>
<p>Still got a +1 from me.</p>

